growth company <span id="xdx_909_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20240308__20240308_zuYcjIBfjGo3"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2024-03-08" format="ixt:booleanfalse" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany" id="ixv-457">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

